# RsiImpossible: Bounded No-Go Theorem for Recursive Self-Improvement in Finite Relational Systems

**AuthorityEffect:** None
**Provenance:**
- Paper PO-035 (`zero_container_relational_spacetime_and_witness_holonomy.md`): Zero-container discrete carrier complexes, 9-tuple observer evaluation packets, finite memory register `dim M < \infty`.
- Paper GAP-007 (`fully_governed_and_auditable_agentic_ai_systems.md`): Untrusted proposal engine (Prime -1) with zero authority, seven-stage perimeter, fail-closed verification gates.
- Paper FOC-000 / FOC-006 (`primitive_axiomatics.rs`): Primitive Difference Axioms A1–A10, unentailed witness admission (Root W), admitted ground `S(0)`.
- Lean 4 Formalizations:
