  - `Level20AutopoieticCohomology.lean`: Boolean diagonal obstruction, Gödel point obstruction on self-reflection.
  - `SLevel.lean` & `RuntimeLimits.lean`: Licensed lifts consume finite budget (`target.liftBudget < source.liftBudget`).

This module formalizes:
1. Container-free relational carriers and relational models with pre-genesis admitted ground.
2. Relational alignment ("intelligence" in this model) as intersubjective communicative invariant preservation within finite carrier bounds.
3. Recursive Self-Improvement (RSI) transition systems and dominance preorders.
4. Three interacting obstructions:
   - Obstruction 1: Relational Carrier Finitude (Pigeonhole / Bounded Ceiling).
   - Obstruction 2: Metric Collapse / Goodhart Decoupling.
   - Obstruction 3: Intersubjective Decoherence.
5. Budgeted carrier lifting bounds (epistemic horizon expansion limits):
