   - `theorem rsi_internal_impossible`: Internal proxy metric dominance no-go theorem.
   - `theorem rsi_carrier_impossible`: Carrier-grounded state dominance no-go theorem.
   - `theorem rsi_step_impossible`: Constructive proof that no RSI self-improvement step endomorphism exists.
